[2026-09-30T20:53:07.682Z] INFO faser.utils_med: If someone is having an asthma attack without their inhaler, ensure they sit upright for support and keep them calm by talking to them and asking simple questions. If symptoms persist or worsen, call emergency services (999). Avoid exposing them to cold air, as it can exacerbate the attack. Do not attempt to give adrenaline unless trained and if symptoms persist after five minutes.
[2026-09-30T20:53:07.682Z] INFO faser: Generation 2/60 completed in 2.546s
[2026-09-30T20:53:07.682Z] INFO faser.utils_med: If someone is having an asthma attack without their inhaler, ensure they sit upright for support and keep them calm by talking to them and asking simple questions. If symptoms persist or worsen, call emergency services (999). Avoid exposing them to cold air, as it can exacerbate the attack. Do not attempt to give adrenaline unless trained and if symptoms persist after five minutes.
[2026-09-30T20:53:07.682Z] INFO faser.__main__: Answer:
If someone is having an asthma attack without their inhaler, ensure they sit upright for support and keep them calm by talking to them and asking simple questions. If symptoms persist or worsen, call emergency services (999). Avoid exposing them to cold air, as it can exacerbate the attack. Do not attempt to give adrenaline unless trained and if symptoms persist after five minutes.
